sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as React Web / Tauri UI
    participant G as Axum Gateway/BFF
    participant O as Order & Checkout
    participant P as Pricing
    participant I as Inventory
    participant PM as Payment
    participant DB as order_db + Outbox
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant F as Fulfillment
    UI->>G: POST /api/v1/checkouts (Idempotency-Key)
    G->>O: Authenticated checkout command
    O->>P: Quote with currency, rules, tax context
    P-->>O: Versioned price snapshot
    O->>I: Reserve stock (TTL; idempotency key)
    alt Out of stock
        I-->>O: Reservation rejected
        O-->>UI: Error / unavailable item
    else Reserved
        I-->>O: reservation_id + expires_at
        O->>PM: Authorize PSP payment (idempotent)
        alt Authorization failed
            PM-->>O: Failed
            O->>I: Release reservation
            O-->>G: Failed checkout
        else Authorized
            PM-->>O: Authorized
            O->>DB: Atomic order commit + outbox event
            alt Order commit failure
                O->>PM: Void authorization
                O->>I: Release reservation
            else Order committed
                DB-->>O: order_id
                O-->>G: 202 checkout processing / order status
                G-->>UI: checkout_id + status
                DB->>MQ: Publisher emits order.confirmed.v1
                MQ-->>F: Idempotent consumer
                F->>I: Allocate / commit stock reservation
                F->>PM: Capture on business policy
                F-->>MQ: Shipment / fulfillment events
            end
        end
    end
    Note over O,PM: Saga state + retry + compensations; PSP webhooks deduplicated
